      "date": "2026-05-20T12:51:38.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.57 (vs ₹4.29 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.57 (up from ₹4.29 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹13.4b (up 7.2% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹484.3m (up 30% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 3.6% (up from 3.0% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 6% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 13% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
