      "title": "Nelcast Limited Recommends Dividend for the Financial Year 2025-26",
      "body": "Nelcast Limited announced that at the Board Meeting Held on May 18, 2026, The Board of Directors have recommended a dividend of 35% i.e., INR 0.70 per share of INR 2/- paid-up for the financial year 2025-26 subject To Approve the shareholders at the upcoming 44th AGM. The dividend, if approved by the members, will be paid within 30 days from the date of declaration at the upcoming Annual General Meeting.",
